2026-11-16T20:47:00.0386300Z # Public install validated its staged bundle and published a receipt-bound alternate app.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0388750Z # A foreign listener survived the launcher refusal and no store was initialized.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0391990Z # An occupied store without its key refused before spawn and preserved its contents.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0404700Z # Concurrent cold attempts completed and a single verified gateway served both built shells after both launchers exited.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0409020Z # Warm launch kept the serving PID and private managed logs excluded the request query.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0415350Z # A second built API entry contended on the actual physical log reservation before touching its store.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0416460Z # The actual managed API refused a missing local key at the store stage, preserving database bytes.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0422590Z # Same-path replacement kept the alternate identity and logged the held-store deadline refusal.
2026-11-16T20:47:00.0425050Z # Supported drain released both leases, the verified process birth and the loopback listener.
